{{Protection}}{{MagicWords}}{{Heroic Card Infobox|Cost=5|AbilityCost=2|Rarity=Rare|Type=Troop|Arena=Spell Valley|ReleaseDate=5 January 2026|image=Hero_Wizard.jpg}}{{Quote|After a decade of demolishing King Towers, Hero Wizard has learned to wield fire for flight! His wings were forged in flame and fortune, but they’re mysteriously cool to the touch.}}

The Hero Wizard is a {{Rarity|Rare}} card that is unlocked by spending 200 hero coins at once. The Hero Wizard takes the appearance of a man who has blonde eyebrows, mustache and goatee, and wears a beige cloak, a team-colored shirt, loincloth and pants, with all of them having a gold outline, a belt with a [[Heroes|Hero Shard]] in the middle, two gold bracelets on his arms, and a pair of brown boots, while donning a pair of fiery golden wings. This card costs 5 {{Icon|I=Elixir}}to put on the arena and an additional 2 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to activate his ability.

== Ability: Fiery Flight ==
{{Quote|Launches into the air and throws fearsome fire tornadoes.}}{{Hero Ability|2=Wizard-Heroic}}
The Hero Wizard has a special ability accessible from whatever side of the screen was put in, just above the player's [[Cards|card]] slots in [[Basics of Battle|battle]]. After a 1-second delay, the Hero Wizard activates his fiery flight, which makes him take flight for 5 seconds. While he is flying, not only he will get a 50% movement speed increase (now classified as fast), his fireballs also create 3 tile radius tornadoes, which does its own damage (reduced against crown towers), similar to the [[Valkyrie/Evolution|Evolved Valkyrie]]. The ability costs 2 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to activate.

== Strategy ==
*Use your Hero Wizard's ability to pull back win conditions such as [[Golem]], [[Giant]], and [[Elixir Golem]] while also cripple/take out supporting units around these cards, such as [[Night Witch]], [[Lumberjack]], [[Witch]], and [[Musketeer]].
*To make the most out of his ability, activate it when he is already attacking enemy troops, so that he does not waste any of his precious ability time moving.
*Hero Wizard’s ability can be used to evade an opposing ground-targeting unit sent to take him out, most commonly [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]]. However, it’s recommended to distract that enemy unit (especially if it has a good amount of health left, or if it is a [[Mini P.E.K.K.A./Hero|Hero Mini P.E.K.K.A.]]) to make your Hero Wizard and Crown Tower safe from potential damage.
*The Hero Wizard's ability can be used to dodge the attacks of troops that cannot attack air troops, such as Mini P.E.K.K.A.
*Cards that decrease attack speed or cause immobilization are good for negating the value Hero Wizard may offer for your opponent, such as [[Ice Wizard]] or [[Vines]], not to mention that Vines can also drag the Hero Wizard to the ground, negating the flying ability.

