== History ==
2026

* Hero Wizard was added to the game on 5/1/2026 with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/1/2026)|January 2026 Update]], along with [[Ice Golem/Hero|Hero Ice Golem]]{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 2/2/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/2/2026)|Balance Update]], increased tornado pull to 250 (from 200){{Balance|Buff}}.
* On 23/2/2026, the [[Version History#2026 Q1 Update (23/2/2026)|2026 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the hero wizards crown tower damage by 64%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], made the ability single use (from 20sec cooldown){{Balance|Remove}}.

